# There is no stage. Without runtime_settings only the 9 base resources are
# declared. Do not put secret values in Terraform variables. CI derives both
# inputs from facts outside Terraform; operators never choose them:
# - runtime_settings: reviewed public identifiers and PINNED secret VERSION
#   NUMBERS only (from the GitHub Environment MYPAGE_RUNTIME_SETTINGS_JSON).
# - public_invoker: true only once the owner's allUsers binding exists; CI imports it.
